{"path":"keyword/template","title":"C++ keyword: template","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ keyword:</span><code>template</code>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/keyword/template","section":"keyword","kind":"index","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/templates\">Declaration of a template</a>\n</li><li> Inside a template definition, <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span></span> can be used to declare that a <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/dependent_name\">dependent name</a> is a template.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/class\"><code>class</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keywords/typename\"><code>typename</code></a>\n</li></ul>\n<table class=\"t-rev-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-until-cxx11\"><td>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/export\"><code>export</code></a> <small>(mark a template definition exported)</small>\n</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-until-cxx11\">(until C++11)</span></td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-rev t-since-cxx20\"><td>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/concept\"><code>concept</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/requires\"><code>requires</code></a>\n</li></ul>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Usage","id":"Usage"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"keyword","title":"C++ keywords"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"C++ keyword: template","children":[{"label":"Usage"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":38,"codeBlockCount":0}
